"The columns of the CSV or Excel statements of this bank, filled in by "
"default when importing."
msgstr ""
"Les columnes dels extractes CSV o Excel d'aquest banc, omplertes per defecte"
" en importar."

#. module: om_account_bank_statement_import
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_account_bank_statement_import.field_account_statement_import_map__debit_positive
msgid ""
"The debit column holds the money leaving the account as a positive number. "
"Uncheck it when your bank writes the debits with a minus sign."
msgstr ""
"La columna de deure conté els diners que surten del compte com a nombre "
"positiu. Desmarqueu-ho quan el vostre banc escrigui els deutes amb un signe "
"menys."

#. module: om_account_bank_statement_import
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_account_bank_statement_import.field_account_statement_import_map__column_label
msgid "The description of the transaction."
msgstr "La descripció de la transacció."

#. module: om_account_bank_statement_import
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_account_bank_statement_import.field_account_statement_import_map__file_encoding
